{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/issues/1264","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/issues/1264/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/issues/1264/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/issues/1264/events","html_url":"https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/1264","id":64403468,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2NDQwMzQ2OA==","number":1264,"title":"unref'd timers running in beforeExit time","user":{"login":"brycebaril","id":126482,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjQ4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycebaril","html_url":"https://github.com/brycebaril","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycebaril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycebaril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycebaril/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycebaril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycebaril/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycebaril/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycebaril/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycebaril/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycebaril/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":151728674,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTE3Mjg2NzQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/labels/confirmed-bug","name":"confirmed-bug","color":"fc2929","default":false,"description":"Issues with confirmed bugs."},{"id":155435976,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTU0MzU5NzY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/labels/timers","name":"timers","color":"f7c6c7","default":false,"description":"Issues and PRs related to the timers subsystem / setImmediate, setInterval, setTimeout."}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":14,"created_at":"2015-03-26T00:29:14Z","updated_at":"2015-10-20T18:28:10Z","closed_at":"2015-10-20T18:28:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When working out this test case for #1152 I came up with this:\n\n``` js\nvar assert = require(\"assert\")\nvar intervals = 0\nvar i = setInterval(function () {\n  intervals++\n  i.unref()\n  eatTime()\n}, 10)\n\nfunction eatTime() {\n  // the goal of this function is to take longer than 10ms, i.e. longer than the interval\n  var count = 0\n  while (count++ < 1e7) {\n    Math.random()\n  }\n}\n\nprocess.on(\"exit\", function () {\n  assert.equal(intervals, 1)\n})\n```\n\nNote -- this requires the patch in #1152 to even terminate, or running Node.js 0.12+ which already has that fix.\n\nI think what happens here is the blocking time causes the repeat time to trigger and the unreferenced timer gets executed in the `beforeExit` timeframe (https://github.com/joyent/node/commit/a2eeb43) when it shouldn't be. This can result in your application not terminating when it should, and functions that should not be executed being run.\n\nThis is a separate bug than #1151 (with fix #1152) and is not fixed by #1231\n","closed_by":{"login":"indutny","id":238531,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzODUzMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238531?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny","html_url":"https://github.com/indutny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/issues/1264/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/issues/1264/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}